            "\n",
            "\t5. Write a Python script that uses OpenCV to detect and track faces in a video file:\n",
            "\n",
            "\t\\begin{lstlisting}[language=Python]\n",
            "import cv2\n",
            "\n",
            "video_path = \"path/to/video/file.mp4\"\n",
