            "\n",
            "\t\\begin{enumerate}\n",
            "\t\t\\item Subtract 7 from both sides of the equation:  $3x + 7 - 7 = 16 - 7$ \\\\   $3x = 9$\n",
            "\t\t\\item Divide both sides of the equation by $3$:   $\\dfrac{3x}{3} = \\dfrac{9}{3}$ \\\\ $x = 3$\n",
            "\t\\end{enumerate}\n",
            "\n",
            "\tSo, the solution is x = 3.\n",
            "\\end{AIBoxBreak}\n",
